{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Battle for Survival Between Two Dimensions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ABSYM, a dark rogue-souls-like that will take you to the edges of reality. Traverse the fragile balance between the decaying world of Nihilor and the corrupted parallel dimension of Absymalith. Face deadly challenges, explore stunning environments, and uncover the secrets of a universe on the brink of collapse. Every step brings you closer to redemption... or total corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>  </u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/8b8c15f1f79f0ca07494bf2a007d4218.avif?t=1772015729\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance on the knife-edge of survival. Phase into the corrupted realm to dodge a fatal blow, then shift back instantly to strike from an unexpected angle. The environment is your most versatile weapon.<br> <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/fa99f48b7c23dea2f3c056095351bada.poster.avif?t=1772015729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/fa99f48b7c23dea2f3c056095351bada.webm?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/fa99f48b7c23dea2f3c056095351bada.mp4?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/437beb3bef29cbc051e4ff324081014b.avif?t=1772015729\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace corruption for power.\u00a0Will you remain pure but weak, or channel the corruption of Absymalith to shatter your limits? Every boon grants immense power, but it brings you one step closer to losing your humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/f75c2fc8dab873b495aa432b72719019.poster.avif?t=1772015729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/f75c2fc8dab873b495aa432b72719019.webm?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/f75c2fc8dab873b495aa432b72719019.mp4?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong> </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/d0116ad01a6b3209700b8d8e7275233c.avif?t=1772015729\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Minimal ambient soundscapes give way to intense orchestral compositions during boss battles. Each fight against the Lords of Corruption is a unique sensory experience, both visually and aurally.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/ba10ca286775f176620c3a2474dd5293.poster.avif?t=1772015729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/ba10ca286775f176620c3a2474dd5293.webm?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/ba10ca286775f176620c3a2474dd5293.mp4?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>  </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/af485b50c2a94a978aca9101933f046a.avif?t=1772015729\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>If you love the brutal challenge of a souls-like, the variety of a rogue-like, and a world that invites you to lose yourself in its details, ABSYM is the game you've been waiting for. Prepare to test your skill, your wits, and your ability to resist corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The question isn\u2019t whether you\u2019ll survive, but at what cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add to your wishlist now and get ready to enter the Rift! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2863300?t=1772015729","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2863300?t=1772015729","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/666af7de38ecb4f12932df037f35c919a071c69b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772015729","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/666af7de38ecb4f12932df037f35c919a071c69b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772015729","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Battle for Survival Between Two Dimensions</strong></