 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace corruption for power.\u00a0Will you remain pure but weak, or channel the corruption of Absymalith to shatter your limits? Every boon grants immense power, but it brings you one step closer to losing your humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/f75c2fc8dab873b495aa432b72719019.poster.avif?t=1772015729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/f75c2fc8dab873b495aa432b72719019.webm?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/f75c2fc8dab873b495aa432b72719019.mp4?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong> </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/d0116ad01a6b3209700b8d8e7275233c.avif?t=1772015729\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>Minimal ambient soundscapes give way to intense orchestral compositions during boss battles. Each fight against the Lords of Corruption is a unique sensory experience, both visually and aurally.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/ba10ca286775f176620c3a2474dd5293.poster.avif?t=1772015729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2863300/extras/ba10ca286775f176620c3a2474dd5293.webm?t=1772015729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akama